; the feast reaches every player within `reach` m of the tavern, online too); rumour_minutes = how often one player hears a rumour (it pins an unfound salvage spot on his chart); tavern effects card_at / card_yaw = where the card table stands per level (model space x, f); dock effects berths (how many of the `berths` sea spots are moorings), quay_repair (share of max hull a second a moored ship mends), beacon (the harbour light shines at night); residents = the person who runs each building (stands at its door when it is up); townsfolk = people walking the streets (start + per_growth x growth). NAMES AND LINES ARE MY PLACEHOLDERS.",
